{"id":"lele-510","title":"202409 青少年等级考试机器人理论真题一级","subject":"robot","subjectName":"电子学会机器人","level":1,"yearmonth":"202409","year":"2024","count":45,"questions":[{"no":1,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，下列哪个选项是机器人? （ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241022/17295691938035.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"智能机器人属于第几代机器人？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：第一代"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：第二代"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：第三代"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：第四代"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"第三代: 智能机器人 ，这类机器人是当今最新、最热门的研究课题，其中“仿人形智能机器人”(也称类人型)为最顶端的追求。这类机器人装有仿人的感知器官，是由多种性能先进且能互相“融合”的传感器构成，具有很强的自适应能力;具有逻辑思维能力，能进行推理、判断、自学、自理、自决功能;具有识别对象、感知环境、随机应变等能力;可以进行复杂的劳动和代替人类部分脑力劳动。智能机器人的研究水平的高低，在一定程度上是一个国家高科技实力和发展水平的重要标志。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，以下工具哪个是羊角锤？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241022/17295693336221.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，这个工具是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241022/17295694177666.jpeg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：撬棍"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：扳手"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：螺丝刀"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：羊角锤"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，以下哪个选项是平齿轮？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241022/17295694813043.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"关于单摆，下列说法正确的是？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：摆动周期与摆长无关"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：同一个单摆摆长越长摆动周期越长"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：单摆的摆动周期无法计算"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：所有单摆的摆动周期相等"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"在理想情况下，即当摆角较小（小于10°）时，单摆的运动可以近似为简谐运动，其周期公式可以表示为T=2π√(L/g)，其中T是摆动周期，L是摆长，g是重力加速度。从这个公式可以看出，单摆的摆动周期与其摆长的平方根成正比。这意味着，随着摆长的增加，摆动周期也会相应地增加；相反，摆长减少则周期减小。","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，使用方向盘相当于使用了？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241022/17295696557753.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：轮轴"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：斜面"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：齿轮"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：滑轮"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，斧头的形状应用了？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241022/17295697115143.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：齿轮"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：斜面"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：动滑轮"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：定滑轮"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，以下框架结构最不容易变形的是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241022/17295697585783.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图，使用该工具相当于使用了省力杠杆，它的支点是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20241022/17295698023132.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":11,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"关于小朋友荡秋千，下列说法正确的是？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：最低点时势能最大"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：最高点时势能最大"